서","x":1106,"y":1527,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"가장","x":1287,"y":1527,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"중요한","x":1368,"y":1528,"width":104,"height":37}]},{"text":"주제라고 확신할 수 있길 바란다. 훌륭한 1Pv4 주소체계 논의를 [Stewart 1999]의 첫","words":[{"text":"주제라고","x":147,"y":1592,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"확신할","x":293,"y":1591,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":414,"y":1592,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"있길","x":468,"y":1590,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"바란다.","x":552,"y":1589,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"훌륭한","x":679,"y":1587,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"1Pv4","x":795,"y":1592,"width":72,"height":27},{"text":"주소체계","x":882,"y":1589,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"논의를","x":1032,"y":1588,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"[Stewart","x":1151,"y":1592,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"1999]의","x":1300,"y":1588,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"첫","x":1438,"y":1588,"width":31,"height":38}]},{"text":"번째 장에서 찾을 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"번째","x":149,"y":1652,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"장에서","x":221,"y":1652,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"찾을","x":338,"y":1651,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":421,"y":1651,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":472,"y":1649,"width":76,"height":37}]},{"text":"IP 주소체계를 살펴보기 전에 호스트와 라우터가 인터넷에 연결되는 방식에 관한","words":[{"text":"IP","x":208,"y":1716,"width":32,"height":27},{"text":"주소체계를","x":254,"y":1711,"width":179,"height":38},{"text":"살펴보기","x":446,"y":1709,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"전에","x":605,"y":1708,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"호스트와","x":685,"y":1707,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"라우터가","x":835,"y":1706,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"인터넷에","x":986,"y":1708,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"연결되는","x":1136,"y":1709,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"방식에","x":1285,"y":1709,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"관한","x":1401,"y":1709,"width":70,"height":37}]},{"text":"몇 가지 단어를 정의할 필요가 있다. 호스트는 일반적으로 네트워크와 연결되는 하나","words":[{"text":"몇","x":148,"y":1772,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"가지","x":192,"y":1771,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"단어를","x":273,"y":1772,"width":105,"height":36},{"text":"정의할","x":395,"y":1770,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"필요가","x":518,"y":1769,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":639,"y":1767,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"호스트는","x":729,"y":1768,"width":136,"height":35},{"text":"일반적으로","x":881,"y":1767,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크와","x":1065,"y":1769,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"연결되는","x":1252,"y":1769,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"하나","x":1401,"y":1770,"width":69,"height":38}]},{"text":"의 링크를 가진다. 호스트 IP가 데이터그램을 보낼 때 이 링크를 통해 데이터링그를 보","words":[{"text":"의","x":148,"y":1832,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"링크를","x":190,"y":1831,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"가진다.","x":303,"y":1831,"width":114,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":433,"y":1833,"width":106,"height":30},{"text":"IP가","x":552,"y":1830,"width":71,"height":37},{"text":"데이터그램을","x":637,"y":1827,"width":202,"height":39},{"text":"보낼","x":850,"y":1828,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"때","x":932,"y":1829,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":977,"y":1829,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"링크를","x":1025,"y":1830,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"통해","x":1136,"y":1831,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"데이터링그를","x":1220,"y":1830,"width":203,"height":38},{"text":"보","x":1435,"y":1834,"width":35,"height":29}]},{"text":"낸다. 호스트와 물리적 링크 사이의 경계를 인터페이스라고 부른다. 이제 라우터와 인","words":[{"text":"낸다.","x":148,"y":1892,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"호스트와","x":233,"y":1892,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"물리적","x":388,"y":1891,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":512,"y":1890,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"사이의","x":594,"y":1889,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"경계를","x":713,"y":1888,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"인터페이스라고","x":827,"y":1888,"width":236,"height":38},{"text":"부른다.","x":1076,"y":1890,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"이제","x":1205,"y":1891,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"라우터와","x":1287,"y":1890,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"인","x":1438,"y":1893,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"터페이스를 고려해보자. 라우터의 작업은 한 링크로부터 데이터그램을 수신하여 다른","words":[{"text":"터페이스를","x":148,"y":1952,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"고려해보자.","x":329,"y":1951,"width":186,"height":39},{"text":"라우터의","x":534,"y":1950,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"작업은","x":685,"y":1948,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":799,"y":1947,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"링크로부터","x":850,"y":1948,"width":162,"height":38},{"text":"데이터그램을","x":1032,"y":1949,"width":205,"height":38},{"text":"수신하여","x":1249,"y":1952,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1401,"y":1952,"width":68,"height":37}]},{"text":"링크로 전달하는 것이므로 라우터는 2개 이상의 연결된 링크가 필요하다. 라우터와 이","words":[{"text":"링크로","x":150,"y":2014,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"전달하는","x":258,"y":2013,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"것이므로","x":414,"y":2012,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"라우터는","x":571,"y":2010,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"2개","x":718,"y":2008,"width":50,"height":37},{"text":"이상의","x":784,"y":2008,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"연결된","x":900,"y":2009,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"링크가","x":1014,"y":2010,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"필요하다.","x":1127,"y":2011,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"라우터와","x":1286,"y":2012,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1436,"y":2013,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"런 링크 사이의 경계 또한 인터페이스라 하는데 각 링크마다 하나의 인터페이스를 가","words":[{"text":"런","x":151,"y":2075,"width":26,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":194,"y":2074,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"사이의","x":274,"y":2074,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"경계","x":398,"y":2073,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"또한","x":483,"y":2072,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"인터페이스라","x":571,"y":2069,"width":202,"height":40},{"text":"하는데","x":786,"y":2068,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"각","x":902,"y":2070,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"링크마다","x":952,"y":2071,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"하나의","x":1099,"y":2071,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"인터페이스를","x":1217,"y":2072,"width":203,"height":40},{"text":"가","x":1435,"y":2074,"width":34,"height":38}]},{"text":"지고 하나의 라우터는 여러 개의 인터페이스를 가진다. 모든 호스트와 라우터는 IP 데","words":[{"text":"지고","x":151,"y":2137,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"하나의","x":225,"y":2136,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"라우터는","x":345,"y":2134,"width":142,"height":40},{"text":"여러","x":503,"y":2133,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"개의","x":587,"y":2132,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"인터페이스를","x":670,"y":2131,"width":200,"height":40},{"text":"가진다.","x":884,"y":2132,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"모든","x":1006,"y":2135,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"호스트와","x":1087,"y":2134,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"라우터는","x":1238,"y":2134,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":1385,"y":2140,"width":35,"height":29},{"text":"데","x":1436,"y":2136,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"이터그램을 송수신할 수 있으므로 IP는 각 호스트와 라우터 인터페이스가 IP 주소를","words":[{"text":"이터그램을","x":151,"y":2198,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"송수신할","x":333,"y":2196,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":492,"y":2196,"width":36,"height":38},{"text":"있으므로","x":546,"y":2196,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"IP는","x":698,"y":2197,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":782,"y":2194,"width":34,"height":40},{"text":"호스트와","x":830,"y":2196,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"라우터","x":982,"y":2196,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"인터페이스가","x":1099,"y":2196,"width":202,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":1315,"y":2202,"width":35,"height":29},{"text":"주소를","x":1365,"y":2199,"width":104,"height":37}]},{"text":"갖도록 요구한다. 따라서 기술 면에서 IP 주소는 인터페이스를 포함하는 호스트 라우터보다","words":[{"text":"갖도록","x":151,"y":2262,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"요구한다.","x":258,"y":2259,"width":150,"height":40},{"text":"따라서","x":424,"y":2260,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"기술","x":536,"y":2260,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"면에서","x":614,"y":2259,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"IP","x":718,"y":2263,"width":37,"height":29},{"text":"주소는","x":764,"y":2260,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"인터페이스를","x":871,"y":2260,"width":186,"height":36},{"text":"포함하는","x":1067,"y":2261,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"호스트","x":1204,"y":2262,"width":96,"height":31},{"text":"라우터보다","x":1312,"y":2262,"width":157,"height":35}]},{"text":"는 인터페이스와 관련이 있다.","words":[{"text":"는","x":150,"y":2326,"width":28,"height":34},{"text":"인터페이스와","x":189,"y":2324,"width":194,"height":35},{"text":"관련이","x":394,"y":2322,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":508,"y":2322,"width":77,"height":36}]},{"text":"각 IP 주소는 32비트길이(4바이트)이다. 따라서 232개(대략 40억 개) 주소가","words":[{"text":"각","x":211,"y":2384,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"IP","x":257,"y":2389,"width":35,"height":28},{"text":"주소는","x":305,"y":2386,"width":109,"height":36},{"text":"32비트길이(4바이트)이다.","x":427,"y":2383,"width":418,"height":41},{"text":"따라서","x":861,"y":2383,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"232개(대략","x":971,"y":2380,"width":161,"height":43},{"text":"40억","x":1143,"y":2383,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"개)","x":1230,"y":2384,"width":44,"height":39},{"text":"주소가","x":1287,"y":2384,"width":103,"height":38}]},{"text":"가능하다. 이 주소는 일반적으로 주소의 각 바이트를 십진수로 표현하고 주소의 다른","words":[{"text":"가능하다.","x":151,"y":2446,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"이","x":309,"y":2446,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"주소는","x":358,"y":2448,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"일반적으로","x":486,"y":2446,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"주소의","x":674,"y":2446,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"각","x":792,"y":2446,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"바이트를","x":840,"y":2445,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"십진수로","x":988,"y":2445,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"표현하고","x":1136,"y":2446,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"주소의","x":1285,"y":2446,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"다른","x":1402,"y":2446,"width":66,"height":39}]},{"text":"바이트와 점(.)으로 구분하는 십진 표기법(dotted-decimal notation)을 A卜음한다. 예","words":[{"text":"바이트와","x":151,"y":2510,"width":132,"height":40},{"text":"점(.)으로","x":300,"y":2509,"width":145,"height":41},{"text":"구분하는","x":460,"y":2509,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"십진","x":620,"y":2508,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"표기법(dotted-decimal","x":705,"y":2509,"width":357,"height":39},{"text":"notation)을","x":1076,"y":2508,"width":184,"height":40},{"text":"A卜음한다.","x":1275,"y":2508,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"예","x":1435,"y":2507,"width":29,"height":38}]},{"text":"를 들어, IP 주소가 193.32216.9라고하자. 193은 주소의 첫 번째 8비트와 같다. 32는","words":[{"text":"를","x":150,"y":2575,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"들어,","x":192,"y":2573,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":285,"y":2578,"width":35,"height":29},{"text":"주소가","x":334,"y":2572,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"193.32216.9라고하자.","x":461,"y":2571,"width":354,"height":40},{"text":"193은","x":833,"y":2571,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"주소의","x":933,"y":2570,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"첫","x":1048,"y":2570,"width":31,"height":39},{"text":"번째","x":1096,"y":2571,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"8비트와","x":1174,"y":2572,"width":121,"height":38},{"text":"같다.","x":1308,"y":2571,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"32는","x":1397,"y":2572,"width":72,"height":34}]},{"text":"307","words":[{"text":"307","x":1739,"y":121,"width":72,"height":35}]}]}